OpenWrek is an AI-native Web Design OS built to turn ideas
into premium, production-ready websites.

It combines a Second Brain, Knowledge Graph, 100+ specialized
agents, deep research, persistent memory, expert design skills,
MCP-powered tools, browser execution, motion systems, and
continuous visual QA into one autonomous creative workflow.

